  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.14.0 adds rich autocomplete suggestions with separate insertion and display text, descriptions, and caller-owned application data while preserving existing string providers. Version 0.13.0 added typed per-binding command conversion and optional state factories. The package remains backed internally by Workes.ContentSystem and exposes no ContentSystem types publicly. This pre-1.0 release is not a drop-in upgrade from earlier package versions.",
